Insert <StatusBlock></StatusBlock> at the end of the assistant reply:
<StatusBlock>
```json
『{{weekday}} - {{data}} - {{time periods}}-{{time}} - {{location}} - {{weather}} - {{temperature}} 』
# {{character}}  
╒═════ 
🪐 身份: {{身份，可以多个}}
📿 信仰: {{信仰的内容}}
